      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a deep sense of identity loss and desperation. Feeling like you've lost your purpose and that you're no longer the person others relied on can be overwhelming. Acknowledge that it's okay to not be perfect, and that it's normal for people to evolve and grow. Perhaps taking time to reflect on who you are beyond the roles you played in the past will help you discover a new sense of purpose.",
      "source": "target",
